  "prompt": "For each day of March 2025, what was Voltmarkt's average daily units sold over the 7 days ending that day, that day included? Order dates are UTC days. A day with no orders counts as 0, and the first days of March reach back into the last days of February, so every day's average covers 7 full days. Round to 2 decimals. Return two columns, in this order: day and avg_7d_units. Return one row for each day of March. Any row order is fine.",
